      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sv3",
          "text": "The CPSC has issued warnings against specific brands for serious burn hazards.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bv6",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sv5",
          "text": "Colorado law gives injured victims two years from the date of injury to file a product liability claim.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bv8",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sv7",
          "text": "Preserving the defective appliance and documenting injuries promptly strengthens a product liability case.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bvj",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "lvc",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/can-i-sue-for-burn-injury/"
        },
        {
          "_key": "lvf",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/denver-product-liability-lawyer/"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sv9",
          "text": "Stories of pressure cookers malfunctioning are more common than manufacturers want to admit, and they raise a question worth answering: ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sva",
          "text": "Are pressure cookers dangerous?",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "svb",
          "text": " They can be, and the reason usually comes down to the same thing: a company cut corners on safety mechanisms that should have prevented the injury entirely. These appliances depend on a layered system of components working correctly every time. When one fails, the consequences, often severe ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "svd",
          "text": "burn injuries",
          "marks": [
            "lvc"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sve",
          "text": ", are immediate. In Denver, our",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "svg",
          "text": " product liability attorneys",
          "marks": [
            "strong",
            "lvf"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "svh",
          "text": " ",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "svi",
          "text": "have seen those failures up close, and we are here to help.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bvl",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "svk",
          "text": "How Does a Pressure Cooker Work?",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bvn",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "svm",
          "text": "A pressure cooker is a sealed vessel that traps steam from boiling liquid, raising the boiling point of water and cooking food far faster than conventional methods. A meal taking hours in a slow cooker can be ready in under 30 minutes.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bvp",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "svo",
          "text": "This speed depends entirely on safety mechanisms working correctly. Pressure release valves, lid locks, and temperature sensors must function in coordination. A defect in any one of them turns a routine meal into a serious hazard.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bvr",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "svq",
          "text": "The Dangers of a Pressure Cooker",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bvt",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "svs",
          "text": "The core danger of a pressure cooker is an uncontrolled release of pressurized steam and superheated contents. Explosions result from blocked safety valves, defective lid locks, damaged seals, or failing temperature sensors that allow the unit to keep heating past safe limits. These are not accidents. They are the predictable outcome of safety systems that were poorly designed or never built to adequate standards.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bvy",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "lvv",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.cpsc.gov/Warnings/2026/CPSC-Warns-Consumers-to-Immediately-Stop-Using-Gourmia-Pressure-Cookers-Due-to-Serious-Burn-Hazard-Multiple-Burn-Injuries-Reported-Majority-Sold-at-Best-Buy"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "svu",
          "text": "Federal regulators have taken notice. The",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "svw",
          "text": " U.S. Consumer Product Safety Commission",
          "marks": [
            "lvv"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "svx",
          "text": " has issued warnings about specific pressure cooker models after consumers reported serious burn injuries, attributing the pattern to product defects rather than misuse. When a federal agency steps in to warn the public, the problem is systemic, and injured consumers have legal options worth pursuing under Colorado product liability law.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bw0",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "svz",
          "text": "Injuries Caused by Pressure Cookers",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bw4",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sw1",
          "text": "Superheated steam and pressurized liquid act instantly, and by the time a person realizes something has gone wrong, the damage is already done. For those wondering if",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sw2",
          "text": " pressure cookers are dangerous",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sw3",
          "text": ", the injuries our team sees in these cases speak for themselves. They may include:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bw7",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sw5",
          "text": "Burn Injuries:",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sw6",
          "text": " Scalding from steam or hot liquid on the face, neck, hands, and chest, sometimes requiring skin grafting and resulting in permanent scarring.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bwa",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sw8",
          "text": "Lacerations:",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sw9",
          "text": " Shrapnel from a failed lid or housing can cause deep cuts requiring surgical intervention.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bwd",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "swb",
          "text": "Eye Injuries:",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "swc",
          "text": " Steam and liquid released at close range can permanently impair vision.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bwg",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "swe",
          "text": "Scarring and Disfigurement:",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "swf",
          "text": " High-temperature injuries to the face and upper body leave lasting physical and psychological effects.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bwj",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "swh",
          "text": "Blunt Force Trauma:",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "swi",
          "text": " A violently ejected lid can cause bruising, fractures, or head injuries.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bwl",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "swk",
          "text": "These injuries often demand emergency care, multiple surgeries, and long-term follow-up. Knowing what to do next becomes the immediate priority.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "image",
      "_key": "iwm",
      "src": "./images/2023-04-are-pressure-cookers-dangerous-1-1.jpg",
      "alt": "are pressure cookers dangerous"
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bwo",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "swn",
          "text": "What To Do If You’re Injured by a Defective Pressure Cooker",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bwq",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "swp",
          "text": "The steps taken immediately after a pressure cooker injury can determine the strength of any legal claim that follows:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bwt",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "swr",
          "text": "Seek Medical Attention Immediately:",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sws",
          "text": " Your health comes first, and a medical record created at the time of injury is the foundation of your case.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bww",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "swu",
          "text": "Preserve the Appliance:",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "swv",
          "text": " Do not clean, repair, or discard any parts. The defective unit is physical evidence that an attorney and expert witnesses will need.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bwz",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "swx",
          "text": "Document Everything:",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "swy",
          "text": " Photograph the scene and your injuries before anything is moved or cleaned up.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bx2",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sx0",
          "text": "Contact a Product Liability Attorney:",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sx1",
          "text": " An attorney can assess your claim, identify liable parties, and begin building your case before evidence is lost.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bx7",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "lx4",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://law.justia.com/codes/colorado/title-13/limitation-of-actions/article-80/section-13-80-102/"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sx3",
          "text": "Under",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sx5",
          "text": " Colorado Revised Statutes Section 13-80-102",
          "marks": [
            "lx4"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sx6",
          "text": ", injured individuals have two years from the date of injury to file a personal injury or product liability claim. Missing that deadline bars your right to compensation.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bx9",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sx8",
          "text": "You Should Be Compensated If You Were Injured by a Pressure Cooker",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bxe",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "lxb",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/common-daycare-injuries/"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sxa",
          "text": "When a defective product causes injury, Colorado product liability law provides a path to compensation. You should not bear the financial burden of a manufacturer’s cost-cutting choices, whether the harm comes from a faulty appliance at home or unsafe equipment behind serious ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sxc",
          "text": "daycare injuries",
          "marks": [
            "lxb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sxd",
          "text": ". Recoverable damages typically include medical expenses, lost wages, pain and suffering, and rehabilitation costs.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bxg",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sxf",
          "text": "In rare cases where a manufacturer knew of a defect and chose to ignore it, Colorado law may also allow punitive damages, intended to punish egregious conduct and deter it from happening again.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bxi",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sxh",
          "text": "These cases require thorough investigation: analysis of the appliance, review of recall and safety records, and input from engineering experts. Manufacturers and their insurers defend these claims aggressively, often pointing to user error. An attorney who knows how to build a product liability case makes a real difference.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bxk",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sxj",
          "text": "Choosing a Cooker with Necessary Safety Features",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bxm",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sxl",
          "text": "Not all pressure cookers carry the same risk. The features that separate a safe unit from a dangerous one are the same features manufacturers cut when injuries occur. Those features include:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bxp",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sxn",
          "text": "Redundant Pressure-Release Valves:",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sxo",
          "text": " A reliable cooker includes a primary valve and at least one backup valve, with interior guards to prevent blockage. Skipping them is a cost-cutting choice, not an engineering constraint.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bxs",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sxq",
          "text": "Physical Lid-Locking Mechanisms:",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sxr",
          "text": " The lid should be mechanically incapable of opening while pressurized. If it can be forced open under pressure, the design is inadequate.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bxv",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sxt",
          "text": "Automatic Shutoff Sensors:",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sxu",
          "text": " Electronic sensors that cut power when limits are exceeded provide a final layer of protection. Their absence in budget models is a deliberate omission.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bxy",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sxw",
          "text": "Clear, Product-Integrated Instructions:",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sxx",
          "text": " Critical safety reminders belong on the unit itself. When manufacturers substitute legal boilerplate for practical guidance, confusion follows, and confusion leads to injuries.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "by0",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sxz",
          "text": "When one or more of these features fails or was never included, the manufacturer may bear legal responsibility for what happens next. Understanding that responsibility is the foundation of any product liability claim.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "by2",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sy1",
          "text": "Get Help from a Denver Product Liability Lawyer",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
